/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 629 Tm (When reading papers in this family, keep three quantities apart: the closed-form) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 613.5 Tm (posterior q\(xt-1 | xt, x0\), the learned reverse kernel p_theta\(xt-1 | xt\), and the) Tj
